<title>USA: High Yield Income decreases monthly div.</title>
<headline>High Yield Income decreases monthly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>High Yield Income Fund said it decreased its monthly dividend to $0.06 to $0.065 because of a declining corporate credit lending rate and the frequency of bond calls.</p>
<p>The latest dividend is payable March 31 to shareholders of record on March 15.</p>
</text>
